# Privacy Policy for Fruitle

**Effective Date: November 9, 2026**

Thank you for playing Fruitle.

Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how information may be collected and used when you use the Fruitle mobile application.

## 1. Information We Collect

Fruitle does not require you to create an account, and we do not ask you for information such as your name, email address, phone number or postal address.

Fruitle uses third-party advertising services, including Google AdMob. These services may automatically collect certain information from your device in order to provide advertisements, measure their performance, prevent fraud, and maintain the advertising service.

Depending on your device, settings, location, and consent choices, this information may include:

* IP address
* Device and advertising identifiers
* General device information
* App interactions, such as app launches, taps, and ad interactions
* Diagnostic and performance information
* Approximate location derived from information such as your IP address

We do not directly receive information that identifies you personally from Google AdMob.

The game's puzzles, music and sounds are included with the app. The Daily Fruitle puzzle is chosen from your device's date, without contacting any server. Fruitle does not use your device's microphone, camera, contacts or location services.

## 2. Information Stored on Your Device

Fruitle keeps a record of your play so that your progress, awards and settings are there the next time you play. This includes:

* Your games played, wins, streaks and the number of guesses each win took, for each game mode
* Your Daily Fruitle puzzles: the guesses you made each day and whether you solved it
* The awards you have earned, when each was earned, and whether you have claimed it
* How many times you have found each fruit, shown in the Collection
* Your best step reached on the Fruit Ladder and how many Classic puzzles you have played
* Your sound settings: sound on or off, and the music and sound effects volumes

This information is stored on your own device. It is not transmitted to us or to any third party, and we have no access to it. If your device backs up its apps' data (on Android, to your Google account), it may include this information in that backup, which is kept by your device's provider, not by us.

You can erase your statistics, daily puzzles and awards at any time using the Reset Progress control on the app's settings screen. Your sound settings are kept until you change them. Uninstalling the app erases everything stored on your device.

## 3. Sharing Your Results

After a puzzle, you can choose Share Result to share it as a short text: the mode, the number of guesses, and a grid of coloured squares showing your marks, without the fruits themselves. Fruitle hands the text to your device's own share sheet, and you choose where it goes. Fruitle sends nothing itself, and nothing is shared unless you choose to.

## 4. Advertising

Fruitle is supported by advertisements provided through Google AdMob.

The app shows a banner advertisement along the bottom of its screens, including while you play.

The app also offers optional rewarded video advertisements. The awards you earn by playing are claimed in the Collection by watching one to the end. Watching a rewarded video is always your choice. If you decline, the award simply stays unclaimed, and you can claim it later.

Depending on your location, device settings, and consent choices, advertisements may be personalized or non-personalized.

Google and its advertising partners may use device identifiers and other information to provide, measure, personalize, and improve advertising and to detect and prevent fraud.

For more information about how Google uses information from apps that use its services, please see Google's privacy information:

https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites

## 5. Internet Access

Fruitle can be played without an internet connection. Advertisements and rewarded videos need one. While your device is offline, rewarded videos are unavailable, so awards can't be claimed until you are back online.

The app does not check your connection separately. It only notices that it is offline when an advertisement cannot reach the internet. It does not look at which network you are connected to.

## 6. Consent and Privacy Choices

Where required by applicable law, users may be presented with a consent message that allows them to make choices regarding the use of their information for advertising purposes, including declining consent.

Where such a choice has been presented, it can be revisited at any time using the Privacy Options control on the app's settings screen.

Users may also be able to control advertising personalization and advertising identifiers through their device privacy settings.

## 7. Children's Privacy

Fruitle is a general-audience game.

We do not knowingly collect personal information directly from children.

Advertising services used by the app may process information as described in this Privacy Policy. Where required, appropriate restrictions are applied to advertising and data processing.

Parents or guardians who have questions regarding their child's privacy may contact us using the email address provided below.

## 8. Data Security

We do not operate our own servers, and Fruitle sends none of your play to us.

Information processed by third-party services such as Google AdMob is handled according to their respective privacy and security practices.

Information sent by the app to these services is encrypted in transit.

## 9. Third-Party Services

Fruitle uses third-party services that may collect or process information according to their own privacy policies:

**Google AdMob**: advertising, including rewarded video advertising, advertising measurement, analytics related to advertising, and fraud prevention. Its consent message is provided by Google's User Messaging Platform.

Google Privacy Policy:
https://policies.google.com/privacy

Information about Google's use of data from apps using Google services:
https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites

## 10. In-App Purchases

Fruitle does not currently offer in-app purchases.

If this changes in the future, this Privacy Policy will be updated where necessary.

